      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "7.1 Meaning of Computer Software"
    },
    {
      "type": "keyFacts",
      "title": "Key Takeaways",
      "items": [
        "Computer software is classified primarily into System Software, Application Software, and Utility Software.",
        "System Software manages hardware resources and provides a platform for application programs to run.",
        "Application Software is designed to perform specific user-oriented tasks such as word processing and browser operations.",
        "Utility Software focuses on system maintenance, configuration, optimization, and security management."
      ],
      "id": "v88wmfz"
    },
